# Font Files Directory

Please add the following font files to this directory:

1. GeistVF.woff - Download from https://vercel.com/font
2. NeueMontreal-Light.woff2 - Premium Sans-Serif font
3. NeueMontreal-Regular.woff2 - Premium Sans-Serif font

Alternative: You can use system fonts by modifying the font configuration in layout.tsx
